ward but at the same time  very hype chapter title we're told that  there's a color spread that's dedicated  to the one piece odyssey video game the  reason that i do get pretty hyped about  the games even though i haven't been a  big gamer recently is that oda usually  designs new characters with new devil  fruit powers for these games which even  if they are not technically canon are  always interesting to hear about  especially when oda drew the design and  came up with the bonus character himself  so in terms of this game that's what  i'll be on the lookout for more than  anything else let me know if you're  hyped about this game in the comments  and if there are any other one-piece  games out there that you'd recommend for  a one-piece stand to play back to the  spoilers and right away oda goes big  delivering on one of the big things that  was teased last chapter but it surprised  me not gonna lie we're told the new  bounties of luffy law and kid are out  and they are 3 billion berries each how  does that happen the image of luffy's  wanted poster is also shown and it's  gear 5 luffy although don't get me wrong  i'm hyped that they have his sun god  form on the poster it just doesn't make  sense to me how does luffy have the same  bounty as law and kid we saw much the  world government feared luffy's  awakening and then he went on to beat  the strongest creature by himself while  law and kit had to tag team big mom and  yet they each get 3 billion it's even  more confusing when we find out who the  new emperors actually are but again more  on that later because it's not revealed  yet for now back to the actual bounties  themselves and i get why the total was 9  billion since it's more than if you add  kaido's bounty of  4.6111 billion two big mobs bounty of  4.388 billion only slightly more but  still it's cool how they add up to 9  billion after they overcome the other  two yonko whose bounties add up to  8.991 billion would have definitely  planned this and 