s  appear and she talks to sukiyaki and  says that pluton is in the land of wano  a huge ancient weapon update  unbelievable how much we're getting in  one chapter pluton aka the world's worst  battleship capable of destroying whole  islands in a single shot was set to  sleep somewhere in alabasta and  crocodile was talking about it way way  back in the day now we may actually get  to see it and i wonder how it'll come  into play would the straw hats actually  switch ships it's doubtful but something  has to happen with it let me know your  thoughts what is the fate of pluton  might the so-called world's worst  battleship go to the world's worst  criminal i don't know but the names  would go well together at the very least  we now jump to greenville whose name is  revealed to be aramaki so it does seem  like he is from moana since that's  definitely a water name he can create  plants no surprise there and this is new  he can absorb people's nutrients from  them we see him using this against king  and queen apparently another insane  encounter that oda just decided to throw  into this jam-packed chapter can't wait  to see this and in what condition king  and queen were in when green bull  presumably bested them like this there's  a big party in the flower capital their  fireworks and if you want to participate  just hit that like button and you too  will see the wano fireworks the least  party guy aka kid arrives at the party  and shows luffy the newspaper and again  something crazy happens truly crazy that  almost feels like an april fool's joke  it's revealed that the four new emperors  are shakes  blackbeard  luffy wait for it  and buggy yes at this point if buggy d  clown is not a d-clan member i'd  honestly be surprised i'm not gonna lie  i do love buggy and this is kind of  amazing to see him with this title it's  clearly not out of nowhere in the sense  that oda did prepare us for this by  making him a warlord first back in the  day could the world government 